# Incident Desk - Email Alert Configuration
# Sender is fixed to rishikvelagapudi@gmail.com
# Default recipient is preset to rishikvelagapudi@gmail.com (can also be changed dynamically in the Workbench interface)

# To send live emails directly via Gmail SMTP, provide your Google App Password below.
